rience Certificates etc. Application Form can be downloaded from the DRDO website www.drdo.gov.in ( DRDO website > Vacancies). Duly filled in application form with supporting documents in PDF format shall be submitted online on email ID: hrd.dysl-sm@gov.in (below 10MB). 3. Screening of eligible applications will be based on GATE score, marks secured in degree, fulfilment of desirability criteria and relevant work experience (if any). The GATE score should be valid as on the date of interview in the aforementioned ",
